            "repere": "Paragraphe · Everyday Whey is a whey and casein ble…",
            "text": "Everyday Whey is a whey and casein blend: creamy, with fast and slow-digesting dairy protein. Everyday Plant is organic pea and brown rice protein: 100% vegan and dairy-free. Both are unflavored, unsweetened and deliver 23g of protein per serving.",
