            "slot": "s1910",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · You get 25% off the protein on every d…",
            "text": "You get 25% off the protein on every delivery, and your first order gets an extra 20% off with the new-customer code applied at checkout. Deliveries come every 6 weeks, which is about how long 42 servings lasts at one a day. You can change flavors, skip a delivery, or cancel any time from your account.",
